1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,389
Itni garmi, aur mera cooler bhi kharab! Upar se jeb bhi khaali.

2
00:00:04,689 --> 00:00:10,807
Ramesh, poore mohalle ke cooler kharab hain. Cooler, pankha aur AC repair seekh le!

3
00:00:11,107 --> 00:00:13,511
Papa, AC to bahut mushkil kaam hai!

4
00:00:13,811 --> 00:00:20,011
ITI ka chhota course kar. Tools, gas cylinder aur meter, 40 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:20,311 --> 00:00:25,992
Garmi aane se pehle, March mein hi dukaan kholna. April se line lagegi.

6
00:00:26,542 --> 00:00:31,718
Ramesh beta, AC thanda nahi kar raha. Ghar mein sab paseene mein naha rahe hain!

7
00:00:32,018 --> 00:00:36,558
Gas check, service, safai. 600 rupaye, uncle. Ek ghante mein thanda!

8
00:00:36,858 --> 00:00:41,905
Garmi mein roz 4-5 service, yaani ₹2,500 se zyada roz.

9
00:00:42,205 --> 00:00:46,774
Sardi mein geyser aur heater repair kar. Saal bhar kaam chalega.

10
00:00:47,074 --> 00:00:50,381
Garmi ne bana di meri kismat! Ramesh ki life set!
